    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The sale of No 46 The Saltings Annagassan Co Louth offers a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious top floor apartment in one of Co Louths most unspoilt locations. \r\nNo 46 is a former 2 bedroom apartment converted now to one bed (reconvertable to its original  2 bed layout) Captivating expansive panoramic view of Dundalk Bay and the Mourne Mountains. \r\nThis bright modern and spacious apartment briefly comprises, Entrance Hall, Open plan living, kitchen and dining area, Bathroom with bath and shower, Bedroom with balcony and en-suite.   \r\nLocated in a much sought after complex having immediate and direct access to Annagassan beach, minute's walk to all village amenities with regular bus connections to Dundalk and Drogheda. Local facilities include, award winning Pub & Restaurant, bio diversity garden and picnic area, first class fishing facilities in Glyde river and the ambience of a rural village of character, approximately only 45 minutes to Dublin Airport. \r\nThe sale of No 46 The Saltings offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a well laid out unique property taking full advantage of the sea views in an area of natural beauty. \r\nFull details on request."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.403m x 1.577m \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Area - 7.385m x 2.244m \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.264m x 2.673m \r\nTiled floor, fitted presses, integrated oven & hob\r\n\r\nBedroom - 4.206m x 3.496m \r\nBalcony \r\n\r\nEnsuite - 1.559m x 1.703m \r\nWc, whb, shower \r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.134m x 2.522m \r\nWc, whb, bath \r\n\r\n"
